What I checked:
• **Bump and renames:** `yoagent` is now 0.25.2 in `Cargo.toml` and `Cargo.lock`. All five `AgentMessage::Extension` sites in `src/commands_info.rs`, `src/commands_session.rs` and src/prompt_utils.rs are now Custom, and a grep of src/ finds none left.
